{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14219080","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14219080","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1421908001:1":{"text":"「神々の祝福を受けし時代」……これは、ヘクト様とドワーフの関係性が一番良かった時代のことだな。","source_cn":"深受神明之眷……这指的是赫托与矮人关系最亲密的那段时光吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE389202A9E390BB3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1421908002:1":{"text":"ちょうど、ドワーフたちが鍛造技術と魔力を手に入れて、帝国を築き始めた頃だ。","source_cn":"那时的矮人一族刚掌握了锻造技艺与魔力，正是意气风发、见...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1241EFF85344C4B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1421908003:1":{"text":"その頃の記録はほとんど残ってないから、帝国初期の歴史を知る上で、この石碑はすごく貴重だよ！","source_cn":"描述这段历史的史料极为稀少，这块石碑可以作为我们了解钢...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE0C7F08AC18B5D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1421908004:1":{"text":"気になるのは後ろの部分なんだ。「ドワーフ此処に祭りを為す……ドワーフの宝をもって祭れ」って……どういうことなんだろう？","source_cn":"我更在意的是后面的句子，矮人于此作祝日……祭以矮人珍重...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8778A1D67D595410","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1421908004":{"text":"気になるのは後ろの部分なんだ。「ドワーフ此処に祭りを為す……ドワーフの宝をもって祭れ」って……どういうことなんだろう？","source_cn":"我更在意的是后面的句子，矮人于此作祝日……祭以矮人珍重物……是什么意思呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8778A1D67D595410","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1421908005:1":{"text":"もしかして……伝説の「鍛魂祭」のことか！？昔、ドワーフたちがヘクト様への感謝を込めて、自分の最高傑作を捧げたっていう祭りがあってさ……","source_cn":"我想想……这难道是传说中的锻魂祭？！矮人为了感念赫托的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x00BCE8F299B0DE27","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1421908006:1":{"text":"それが、今毎年やってる鍛魂大会の原点なんだけど、由来を知ってる人は少ないんだよね。","source_cn":"锻魂祭后来慢慢演变成了现在一年一度的锻魂大赛！只是现在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE46957AAD0C108A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1421908007:1":{"text":"俺も子供の頃、そんな話を聞いたな……あの頃は、「神様がこんなにたくさんの品をもらってどうするんだ」って思ったもんだ。","source_cn":"俺小时候好像听过，是有个古老的祭典会让矮人献上珍贵的宝...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D9DD708202CA95B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1421908008:1":{"text":"実際には「捧げる」より「披露する」って意味が強いんだよ。だから、儀式の後、物はちゃんとドワーフたちの元に戻ってきたって話さ。","source_cn":"锻魂祭仪式比起“献予”，更像是“展示”或“认证”……祭...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA777F552E21BE8F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1421908009:1":{"text":"「溶岩水を注ぎ、鍛造晶を献ず。魔力は古碑を浄め、ドワーフの匠の魂は今顕れ出でん」……これは、隠された何かを浮かび上がらせるための手順でしょうか？","source_cn":"奉以熔岩水，奉以锻造晶，魔力荡涤古